Fix ghostty_surface_free_text ABI to match include/ghostty.h.

The header declares ghostty_surface_free_text(ghostty_surface_t,
ghostty_text_s*), but the Zig export took only the text pointer. Callers
following the header pass the surface first, so the export received the
surface as its argument and the text buffer was never freed — leaking on
every text read (selection reads, state-detection polls, etc.).

--- a/src/apprt/embedded.zig
+++ b/src/apprt/embedded.zig
@@ -1675,7 +1675,7 @@
         return true;
     }

-    export fn ghostty_surface_free_text(ptr: *Text) void {
+    export fn ghostty_surface_free_text(_: *Surface, ptr: *Text) void {
         ptr.deinit();
     }

